B.Nc=new A.rZ("Energy, courage and action","Fire stands for drive, warmth and the will to act. In the traditional view it gives a person initiative, confidence and enthusiasm that others can feel.\nFire people like to move first and learn while doing. They often lead, protect and encourage.\nWithout balance the same heat can turn into hurry, anger or tiredness.","Courageous, energetic, direct, optimistic and inspiring.","I act with courage and patience.","Add calm to the day: time near water, slow breathing and a pause before replying. Use cool, soft colours in resting areas.","Invite warmth and movement: morning sunlight, regular exercise and one small decision taken each day. Warm colours may be used with care.")
B.Nd=new A.rZ("Stability, patience and practical sense","Earth stands for steadiness, structure and care for real things. It is linked with people who plan, save and finish what they start.\nEarth people are dependable and prefer proof to promises. They give others a sense of safety.\nWithout balance this steadiness can become stubbornness or fear of change.","Reliable, patient, practical, careful and loyal.","I build steadily and stay open to change.","Bring in lightness: try something new, travel a little and clear things that are no longer used.","Add grounding: a fixed daily routine, time with plants or soil, and earthy colours such as brown and yellow ochre.")
B.Nb=new A.rZ("Thought, speech and connection","Air stands for ideas, communication and movement of the mind. It is linked with curiosity, learning and friendship.\nAir people enjoy conversation and see many sides of a question. They connect people and ideas.\nWithout balance there may be restlessness, worry or plans that are never finished.","Curious, expressive, friendly, adaptable and inventive.","I think clearly and speak with care.","Settle the mind: finish one task at a time, limit screen time and walk without distractions.","Open up the space and the mind: fresh air in rooms, reading, new conversations and light colours.")
B.Ne=new A.rZ("Feeling, intuition and care","Water stands for emotion, imagination and the ability to adapt. It is linked with sensitivity, art and deep understanding.\nWater people notice moods quickly and give comfort naturally. They are often creative and intuitive.\nWithout balance feelings can overflow into moodiness, doubt or withdrawal.","Sensitive, intuitive, caring, imaginative and flexible.","I feel deeply and stay steady.","Give feelings a shape: a journal, a regular schedule and clear boundaries with others. Keep living spaces dry and bright.","Welcome softness: drink enough water, spend time with music or art, and use blue or white in quiet areas.")
